{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1304.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"0e680f156c87855ff74dff90cf592fe1880b760a8917eadf3e6aae950bec2a81","ja":"ああ、試練はクリア！　莉緒こそが\nセクシーを極めし者だ！　その衣装が証だよ！","zh":"啊，通过试炼了！莉绪才是\n性感之巅的登峰造极者！这身服装就是证明哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
