{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1304.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"fe683bb8265613d2327b871b1bb0191b7666e60fa13496de722b52fd094e4e8f","ja":"あ、目が覚めたみたいだね。\n衣装のまま寝るなんて、よっぽど疲れてたんだな。","zh":"啊，看来你醒了呢。\n穿着演出服装就睡着了，看来真的是累坏了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
