{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1304.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"5ddd1c1c1dc992c0851b0af6239abe851b592ba36f925e3c164b1c8570c1c7d0","ja":"こ、こんなに筋肉痛がするなんて……もしかして私、\n本当にセクシーの試練をクリアしたんじゃ……。","zh":"居、居然肌肉酸痛成这样……难道说我、\n真的通过了性感的考验吗……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1304.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"5665d4239cf45fcc71e463421f08ebd19194c85c9cad24e0f0bc9cc5e322a8a6","ja":"何言ってるの？　筋肉痛は、\n昨日、イベントで散々踊ったからじゃない。","zh":"说什么呢？肌肉酸痛\n不是因为昨天在活动上跳得太狠了吗。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
